     ],
     "value": "Detected in smooth and cardiac muscle at high levels and in skeletal muscle at low level. Present in other tissues due to vascular or other smooth muscle component. Low levels are present in liver, kidney, skin and brain (at protein level)"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "TISSUE SPECIFICITY"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "8175905"
      }
     ],
     "value": "In the developing aorta, expressed at low levels in 10-12 week old fetuses. Levels increase progressively in 24 week fetus, 6 month old child and 1.5 year old child aortic smooth muscle, reaching a maximum at maturity"
    }
   ],
